    {
      "flavor_text": "Every time ABSOL appears before people,\nit is followed by a disaster such as an\nearthquake or a tidal wave.\fAs a result, it came to be known as the\ndisaster POKéMON.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ruby",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ABSOL has the ability to foretell the\ncoming of natural disasters.\nIt lives in a harsh, rugged mountain\fenvironment. This POKéMON very rarely\nventures down from the mountains.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sapphire",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It sharply senses even subtle changes in\nthe sky and the land to predict natural\ndisasters. It is a long-lived POKéMON that\nhas a life-span of 100 years.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "emerald",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/9/"
      }
    },
    {
