        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "재해의 위험을 감지한다.\n위험을 알리는 때에만\n사람 앞에 나타난다고 한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il pressent les catastrophes et n’apparaît aux gens\nque pour les prévenir d’un danger imminent.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es spürt drohende Katastrophen und erscheint nur\ndann, wenn es andere vor der Gefahr warnen will.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Presiente desastres inminentes y se aparece a la gente\npara advertir del peligro.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Percepisce i disastri naturali imminenti e si mostra\nsolo per avvertire la gente del pericolo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It senses coming disasters and appears before\npeople only to warn them of impending danger.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "災害を　予感する。\n危険を　知らせる　ときだけ\n人前に　現れるという。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
