      "flavor_text": "Corre veloce come il vento attraverso colline\ne campi. Il suo corno ricurvo è in grado di\nprevedere con precisione le calamità naturali.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Swift as the wind, Absol races through fields and\nmountains. Its curved, bow-like horn is acutely\nsensitive to the warning signs of natural disasters.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "風のように　野山を　駆けぬける。\n弓なりの　ツノは　自然災害の\n予兆を　敏感に　感じとる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "如风一般在山野中奔跑。\n能用它像弓一样的角\n来感知自然灾害的预兆。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Corre por montañas y prados a la velocidad del\nviento. Su cuerno curvado tiene tal sensibilidad\nque puede predecir catástrofes naturales.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "きけんを　さっちする　のうりょくを\nもつがゆえに　ひとからは　わざわいを\nもたらす　ポケモンと　ごかいされた。",
